FPKGi+ is standalone. It is inspired by PKGi by bucanero
(https://github.com/bucanero/pkgi-ps3) and supports FPKGi's content-list
format. It can copy existing local lists once, then maintains its own settings
and data. It contains no PKGi or FPKGi code.

